# Day 35 - External Stylesheets and About Section

## Learning Objectives

- Learned how to link an external CSS file.
- Built an About section.
- Continued building my portfolio website.

## New Concept

### External Stylesheet

Instead of writing CSS inside HTML, we create a separate file.

Example:

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
```

## Practical Work

- Linked style.css with index.html.
- Added an About section.
- Styled the About section using CSS.

## Key Takeaways

- HTML contains the content.
- CSS controls the appearance.
- Keeping CSS in a separate file makes projects easier to maintain.
